<title>ESTONIA: ESTIKO TO ORGANISE NEW SHARE ISSUES.</title>
<headline>ESTIKO TO ORGANISE NEW SHARE ISSUES.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shareholders of plastics firm Estiko on Friday approved the organisation of a pre-emptive share issue of 500,000 E-shares at a price of 40 kroons.</p>
<p>It also said in a statement that the shareholder meeting held today approved an issue shares, in which each holder of A and E shares will get one new share for every three held.</p>
<p>The meeting also approved the 1996 accounts.</p>
<p>-- Tallinn Newsroom +372 630 8400</p>
